# annual events (dates from the Vanuatu Tourism Office events calendar; check each year)
TIP='Dates move from year to year. Check the Vanuatu Tourism Office events calendar before you book.'
X('johnfrum','John Frum Day, Lamakara','events','Tanna',169.4700,-19.5245,'Every year','Followers of the John Frum movement gather at Lamakara on the east side of Mount Yasur for a day of song, dance and a flag-raising to honour the figure they call John Frum.',TIP+' Ask the Tanna visitor centre about visiting respectfully.',True,'15 February')
X('independence','Independence Day, Port Vila','events','Efate',168.3190,-17.7385,'Every year','Port Vila marks independence from Britain and France on 30 July 1980 with a parade, a flag-raising at Independence Park, dancing, canoes in the harbour and food stalls. Bands play around town through the week.',TIP,True,'30 July')
X('festnapuan','Fest\'Napuan music festival, Saralana Park','events','Efate',168.3105,-17.7440,'Three nights','A free, three-night music festival at Saralana Park with local and regional bands. It ran in September in 2025, and in earlier years in October or November.',TIP,True,'September to November')
X('oceanswim','Vanuatu Ocean Swim, Iririki Island','events','Efate',168.3090,-17.7462,'Every year','A swim of 3.2 km or 1.5 km around Iririki Island, a few hundred metres off the Port Vila waterfront. Spectators watch from the seafront.',TIP,True,'June')
X('vilaevents','Town events, Port Vila','events','Efate',168.3150,-17.7420,'Several dates a year','Fete de la Musique on 21 June, Unity Day on 29 November (a parade in traditional dress with groups from many islands) and Christmas in the Park in early to mid December all happen in central Port Vila.',TIP,True,'21 June, 29 November, December')
X('roots','Back to My Roots festival, Ambrym','events','Ambrym',168.1100,-16.1700,'Every year','A three-day cultural event of traditional dance, games and storytelling in a village on Ambrym. Some years it has been listed in Port Vila instead, so confirm the venue.',TIP+' The pin is placed on north Ambrym; the exact village is not confirmed.',True,'August')
X('nalawan','Nalawan Festival, Malekula','events','Malekula',167.4230,-16.1010,'Every year','A two-day festival on Malekula, listed for 23 and 24 August in one recent year.',TIP+' The pin is placed near Lakatoro; the exact village is not confirmed.',True,'late August')
X('vanualava','Vanua Lava Day, Banks Islands','events','Banks Islands',167.5400,-13.8860,'Every year, four days','A four-day island festival on Vanua Lava starting on 1 September.',TIP+' The pin is placed near Sola; the exact village is not confirmed.',True,'1 September')
